6185 TiNT (Network in Transition) Specification v1.0

Status: Project-defined infrastructure specification

Purpose

The TiNT layer models the movement of transactions between processing stages and systems. It describes the topology and traceability of transitions without assigning business semantics to the payload.

⸻

Layer Position

Application Specifications
──────────────────────────
Project Semantics
──────────────────────────
Governance & Audit
──────────────────────────
TiNT (Network in Transition)
──────────────────────────
Execution Specification
──────────────────────────
Abstract Machine
──────────────────────────
Formal Semantic Core
──────────────────────────
Grammar • Serialization • Encodings

⸻

